Come on over and join us at the chat,

64
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:27,000
Like all of our frequent flyers. and we had a few new people show up this week:

65
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:32,000
Rob, who's with PAC-135 and is a committee chair, and Weebelow's den leader,

66
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:37,000
James Longo, who's in Rockford, Michigan, and he's with Troop 228..

67
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Mike Doemer, in Overland Park, Kansas, and he's a member of the committee for his troop

68
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:44,000
and a summer camp coordinator,

69
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:48,000
And he'll be the committee chair for his PAC starting at the beginning of the year.

70
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Thanks to all of you for checking in.

71
