Once again, a live chat over at ScoutMasterCGcom Tuesday and Wednesday mornings.

72
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Most weeks it's going to be a little dicey around the holidays.

73
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,000
I think everybody's going to be busy,

74
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:03,000
But keep an eye on the Facebook feed and the Twitter feed and we'll let you know that we're there.

75
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:10,000
So this week's podcast- number 297, is going to be the last live podcast for this year, for 2015..

76
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:14,000
I'm going to set up some encore presentations for the next three weeks during the holidays

77
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:19,000
And I'll be back with podcast 298 on January 11th

78
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:27,000
And that will set us up for the 300th edition of the ScoutMaster podcast to be published on January 25th.

79
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:32,000
And that's exactly six years from the day I published podcast number one

80
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:37,000
And I've got a few new things ready for 2016 that I'll announce during that podcast.

81
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:41,000
So I get to hear from a lot of folks every week and it's really heartening to hear from you

82
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:45,000
And it's very gratifying to know I can lend you a hand once in a while.

83
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:52,000
What I'm asking for in return is that you support all of this by becoming a ScoutMasterCGcom backer.

84
